    "Highest audio frequency band that drives this. Lower it to ignore hiss and cymbals." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like frequencymax"
    },
    "Highest frequency band that drives the shift. Lower it to ignore cymbals and hiss." : {
