    },
    "Highest frequency band that drives the warp." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the hyperdrive effect's frequencymax parameter"
    },
    "Horizontal" : {},
    "Horizontal scroll speed. Negative scrolls left, 0 stops. Only looks seamless on tiling textures." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the scroll effect's speedx parameter"
    },
    "Horizontal speed. Negative values move the other way, 0 stops." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like speedx"
    },
    "How bright a pixel must be before it casts rays. Lower it to catch more of the image, raise it to keep rays on highlights only." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like ray_threshold"
    },
    "How bright a pixel must be before it glows." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like bloomthreshold"
    },
    "How bright a pixel must be to emit rays. Lower it if nothing glows; raise it if the whole image smears." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the godrays effect's raythreshold parameter"
    },
    "How close a pixel must be to the key colour to be removed. Raise it until the background is gone, then stop — going further eats the subject." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the colorkey effect's tolerance parameter"
    },
    "How closely a pixel must match before it is affected. Raise it until the whole target area is covered, then stop." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like tolerance"
    },
    "How far colour bleeds sideways, like worn tape." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the vhs effect's chromatic parameter"
    },
    "How far the bars react to volume. Raise it for quiet music, lower it if the bars keep hitting the ceiling." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the audiobars effect's strength parameter"
    },
    "How far the blur reaches on each axis." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like blur_scale"
    },
    "How far the hue rotates at full volume." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the hueshift effect's audioamount parameter"
    },
    "How far the image shifts horizontally with the pointer. Needs a depth map; without one nothing moves." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the depthparallax effect's depthx parameter"
    },
    "How far the image shifts vertically with the pointer." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the depthparallax effect's depthy parameter"
    },
    "How far the image stretches into streaks." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the hyperdrive effect's strength parameter"
    },
    "How far the layer moves each shake, in pixels." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the shake effect's strength parameter"
    },
    "How far the layer slides against the pointer. Give background layers more than foreground ones to sell the depth." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the parallax effect's amount parameter"
    },
    "How far the leaves bend." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the foliagesway effect's strength parameter"
    },
    "How far the rays reach from their source." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like ray_length"
    },
    "How far the red and blue channels separate. Keep it small — past a few pixels it stops reading as a lens and starts looking broken." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the chromaticaberration effect's strength parameter"
    },
    "How far the shafts reach from their source." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the godrays effect's raylength parameter"
    },
    "How far the surface is displaced by each ripple." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the waterripple effect's ripplestrength parameter"
    },
    "How far the tracking glitch tears the image sideways." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the vhs effect's distortionstrength parameter"
    },
