      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the foliagesway effect's speeduv parameter"
    },
    "How fast the waves travel." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the waterwaves effect's speed parameter"
    },
    "How gradually the distortion ramps in and out. Low values snap, high values glide." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the nitro effect's smoothness parameter"
    },
    "How gradually the effect blends at its boundary." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like smoothness"
    },
    "How hard the lens bends the image. Negative values pinch inward instead of bulging out." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the fisheye effect's scale parameter"
    },
    "How many bars are drawn across the layer." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the audiobars effect's bars parameter"
    },
