      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the audiobars effect's smoothing parameter"
    },
    "How much of the area the effect fills." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like density"
    },
    "How much of the layer the lens covers. Small values bulge only the centre." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the fisheye effect's size parameter"
    },
    "How much the warp reacts to volume." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the hyperdrive effect's audioamount parameter"
    },
    "How often the pattern repeats over time." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like frequency"
    },
    "How often the tracking glitch rolls through." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the vhs effect's distortionspeed parameter"
    },
    "How quickly each shake settles. High values give a short sharp jolt, low values keep it wobbling." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for the shake effect's friction parameter"
    },
    "How quickly the effect animates. 0 freezes it." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like speed"
    },
    "How quickly the effect fades away from the centre." : {
      "comment" : "Scene Inspector tooltip for an effect parameter named like centerfalloff"
